{"steam_appid":2346410,"steam_name":"Border Pioneer","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2346410/740257256/0c5c07d23ee95b053696256f77e92ea4ed1ce2e9/1754317729/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754582790","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177982/c0c6e089f4cd2971249519068cb3ad44ae1a771d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754582790","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/ss_f2fdfcf4752898344d5249410fb5ed9b2839e89e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/ss_b445f06590b5182d0c395134ba50a34a9d797bd1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/ss_768a992e29fccd3cca25adde69ffbe382b5e2adf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/ss_317a6b688b707784fdf1add7517b7741463c4129.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753690","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/ss_6324c6aef7193105b1ffd7b841b968ff72c8a8af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785753690"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Border Pioneer is a pixel art city-building game that combines survival and defense elements. Fresh from the academy, you must prove your worth by venturing into the frontiers. Face local dangers, manage resources, construct towns, and expand the kingdom's borders into uncharted territories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Village</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/712333f2d1ac1637eb79c66d3efb9dd5.poster.avif?t=1785753690\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/712333f2d1ac1637eb79c66d3efb9dd5.webm?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/712333f2d1ac1637eb79c66d3efb9dd5.mp4?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build Your Town from Scratch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform barren lands into bustling settlements! Start with basic structures and gradually unlock new buildings and units as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect And Expand Your Deck!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/282e0a8f1d94fbf6e5b2913af8ff5bbb.poster.avif?t=1785753690\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/282e0a8f1d94fbf6e5b2913af8ff5bbb.webm?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/282e0a8f1d94fbf6e5b2913af8ff5bbb.mp4?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Build Your Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over 200 unique cards to construct your perfect deck. Use your cards with skill and timing to overcome challenges and build your town efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Fend Off Enemy Assaults!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/9e09fb035ef612c8d038239f3f5d440b.poster.avif?t=1785753690\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/9e09fb035ef612c8d038239f3f5d440b.webm?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346410/extras/9e09fb035ef612c8d038239f3f5d440b.mp4?t=1785753690\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Defend Against Relentless Threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each month, enemies will attempt to destroy the town you so carefully built! Fortify your defenses and repel increasingly powerful waves of attackers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prove Your Worth as a Pioneer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources, plan your town's layout, and make crucial decisions to ensure your town's survival and growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Border Pioneer offers a unique blend of city-building strategy and defensive gameplay. Can you tame the wild frontier and become the world’s most legendary pioneer?</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+) 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4440<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Strategy"],"developers":["Yahzj Games"],"publishers":["Yogscast Games","Gamersky Games"],"release_date":"6 Feb, 2025"}